Key Takeaway

Microsoft Entra ID provides centralized identity management for cloud, hybrid, and external users. By understanding cloud identities, synchronized identities, and guest accounts, Azure Administrators can securely manage authentication, authorization, and resource access across enterprise environments. This is a foundational skill area for the AZ-104 Microsoft Azure Administrator certification.
